{"unit_id":"MicroHEROX__dsh-exa-mcp#feature-search","repo":"MicroHEROX/dsh-exa-mcp","commit":"be2fe2afddc729ff9417f947d654838f513fb8ef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Exa Search MCP for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「网页搜索」：通过 Exa 的远端 MCP 搜索工具查询网页并返回结果。在 DSH 会话中由模型调用搜索工具，输入自然语言查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-10","cordis.patch.yml:35-41"]}
{"unit_id":"MicroHEROX__dsh-exa-mcp#feature-fetch","repo":"MicroHEROX/dsh-exa-mcp","commit":"be2fe2afddc729ff9417f947d654838f513fb8ef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Exa Search MCP for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「网页抓取」：通过 Exa 工具读取已知网址的网页内容，供会话继续处理。模型可在需要页面全文时调用抓取工具，输入一个或多个 URL。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-10"]}
{"unit_id":"MicroHEROX__dsh-exa-mcp#feature-auth","repo":"MicroHEROX/dsh-exa-mcp","commit":"be2fe2afddc729ff9417f947d654838f513fb8ef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Exa Search MCP for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「可选密钥认证」：加载配置时读取 EXA_API_KEY，有值时以 x-api-key 请求头连接 Exa，未设置时使用空请求头进行匿名连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:13-19","cordis.patch.yml:42"]}
{"unit_id":"MicroHEROX__dsh-exa-mcp#feature-agent","repo":"MicroHEROX/dsh-exa-mcp","commit":"be2fe2afddc729ff9417f947d654838f513fb8ef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Exa Search MCP for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「多步研究工具接入」：配置连接后，可由远端服务提供 Agent 研究工具；注释说明该工具需要 API key。用户通过 DSH 会话调用它来处理研究问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-10","cordis.patch.yml:13-17"]}
{"unit_id":"MicroHEROX__dsh-exa-mcp#caveat-1","repo":"MicroHEROX/dsh-exa-mcp","commit":"be2fe2afddc729ff9417f947d654838f513fb8ef","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Exa 搜索与抓取请求发往 mcp.exa.ai；配置 EXA_API_KEY 时该密钥会作为 x-api-key 发送，未设置则匿名连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:39-42"]}
